    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***FOR SALE BY ONLINE AUCTION*** via offr.io platformAUCTION DATE: WEDNESDAY 21ST OCTOBER AT 11AM. REGISTRATION FOR THE AUCTION CLOSES ON TUESDAY 20TH OCTOBER 2026 AT 4PM.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to present this attractive four-bedroom, two-storey detached residence to the market.\nOccupying a generous 0.51-acre (0.21-hectare) site. The substantial grounds also provide ample space for landscaping, recreation, or creating an enhanced outdoor living environment.\nIdeally situated just 2km from Loughill Village and less than an hour's drive from Limerick City, the property enjoys a wonderful balance of peaceful countryside living while remaining within easy reach of local amenities and services.\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance porch, hallway, lounge/dining room, kitchen and sitting room. Upstairs, there are four generous double bedrooms and a family bathroom with WC and WHB.\nThe property is fitted with a oil fired central system and double-glazed uPVC windows.\nHaving been vacant for over two years, the property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the terms, conditions and eligibility criteria of the scheme. This may provide an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking to modernise and enhance the property to their own requirements.\nWith its generous site, spacious accommodation and significant potential, this property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, those seeking a peaceful countryside home, or purchasers looking for a property with scope to create something truly bespoke.\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with Sherry FitzGerald Stack."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 2.05 x 1.90\nwith front door, tiled flooring & 3 windows\n\nLiving Room / Dining Room - 5.08m x 5.05m\nwith oil fired range, carpet flooring & 3 windows.\n\nKitchen - 6.96m x 2.33m\nwith fitted units, sink, linoleum flooring and 2 windows.\n\nSitting Room - 4.77m x 4.47\nwith open fireplace, carpet flooring & 2 windows.\n\nLanding - 5.05m x 1.67m\nwith carpet flooring & 1 window\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.53m x 1.82m\ndouble bedroom with carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.79m x 2.7m\ndouble bedroom with carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.99m x 2.56m\ndouble bedroom with carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.46m x 2.48m\ndouble bedroom with carpet flooring and window\n\nBathroom - 2.46m x 1.77m\nWith w/c, whb, bath, carpet flooring & window.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4-bedroom detached home over two storeys with spacious accommodation.</li><li>0.51-acre site offering excellent space and potential for extension/development, subject to planning.</li><li>Peaceful countryside location, just 2km from Loughill Village and under an hour from Limerick City.</li><li>Oil fired central heating and double-glazed uPVC windows.</li><li>Potential for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, with scope to modernise and create a bespoke home.</ul>"
      },
